All of our current clinical trials involve Plinabulin for multiple indications and we may not be successful in our efforts to identify
or discover additional product candidates. Due to our limited resources and access to capital, we must, and have in the past decided
to, prioritize the development of Plinabulin for different indications. If our current Plinabulin-based product candidates fail to
become viable products, our business will be adversely affected.
